{
    "name": "base",
    "description": "Baseline WinUI3 surface for wxl: the WinForms-equivalent control set (layout, text, buttons, lists, indication, navigation containers, flyouts/menus), trimmed to the members needed to experiment with Flutter-style declarative UI and Command-based model binding. Window and Application are given from above (hand-written, never generated), so they are deliberately absent.",
    "extends": [],

    "windowsAppSdk": "2.4.0",

