            "comment": "The base every icon shares, and Foreground is why it is listed: a glyph that marks something -- a star beside a name, a lock, a warning -- is not the same colour as the text it stands next to, and without this an icon can only inherit whatever its parent happens to be.",
            "members": [
                "Foreground"
            ]
        },

